cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use df11pack, please cite it as below, and cite DFloat11 for the format."
title: "df11pack: a fast, byte-identical DFloat11 compressor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ferrerons Manich"
    given-names: "Arnau"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-7245-7221"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArnauFerma/df11pack"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
abstract: >-
  An independent compressor for the DFloat11 lossless BF16 weight format that
  produces files byte-identical to the official compressor, in seconds and with
  a fraction of the memory, from a single binary with no GPU and no Python.
keywords:
  - lossless compression
  - bfloat16
  - DFloat11
  - Huffman
  - LLM weights
  - diffusion models
license: MIT
references:
  # As the DFloat11 authors ask to be cited (their README).
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "70% Size, 100% Accuracy: Lossless LLM Compression for Efficient GPU Inference via Dynamic-Length Float (DFloat11)"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Zhang"
        given-names: "Tianyi"
